    "name": "Portable Flashing Package: Engineering Firmware for Innioasis Y2 (Android 4.4 AOSP base - MT6582))",
    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=y1-community%2Fy2-ata-rom&amp;tag=y2-ata#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**Y2 \u00b7 Stock**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/releases/download/y2-ata/rom_y2-windows.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/releases/download/y2-ata/rom_y2-linux.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/releases/download/y2-ata/rom_y2-macos.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n# This is a bare android firmware for modifications to the Innioasis Y2 - it includes flash_tool.exe to install it from Windows systems\r\n# This is not suitable for everyday use - the original firmware is [available here](https://github.com/y1-community/y1-stock-rom/releases/tag/3.1.7)\r\nDisconnect your Y2 from USB, fully power it off using a paper clip or pin between the headphone jack and charging port\r\n\r\nRun flash_tool.exe\r\n\r\nSelect Format All + Download from the dropdown that reads \"Download\"\r\n\r\nClick Download (green arrow)\r\n\r\nConnect your Y2 and wait for install to finish.\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"rom_y2-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"3571279e506954d35eb67dd333e3620840acafcb7dd5ec47dfebebacf02f8d06\",\"size\":680265217,\"source_asset\":\"rom_y2.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"rom_y2-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"2e360e96689a9ec3a64997e964768d29b4efbe7d0833cbabac6d0b54dc714642\",\"size\":414232482,\"source_asset\":\"rom_y2.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"rom_y2-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"cab4954302c896730d683703d403238d894672016ed591defcb1b92ca5d10a11\",\"size\":498776235,\"source_asset\":\"rom_y2.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-08T19:56:30Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"e602c4504888a92ccd329d439dc5bb090a4c901dc5e47d98382ad5b919cb1c5b\",\"original_assets\":[\"rom_y2.zip\"],\"skipped\":[],\"stats\":{\"baseline\":{\"rom_y2-linux.zip\":1,\"rom_y2-macos.zip\":2,\"rom_y2-windows.zip\":1,\"rom_y2.zip\":8},\"generated_at\":\"2026-11-08T19:56:30Z\",\"retired\":{}},\"updater\":{\"linux\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Linux-Portable.zip\",\"size\":387920108,\"tag\":\"2.5.1\"},\"macos\":{\"name\":\"Innioasis.Updater.for.Mac.dmg\",\"size\":119787348,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"},\"windows\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Windows-Portable.zip\",\"size\":205854850,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"}},\"v\":11} -->\n",
